===========================================================================
       How to Convert to v4.0 from an earlier version of View_Log!
===========================================================================

    This version of View_Log has undergone some major changes over earlier
versions. The easiest way to convert is to purge your system of any previous
versions and install it from scratch.

    To do this, you will need to delete the following files:

1: In your PFILES: directory, delete the following two files:

            VL_Creator_3.0          View_Log_3.0

2: Also, delete these files from PFILES: if they still exist:

            VL_READ_ME!     VL_LOG_HELP!    VL_HISTORY!

3: From your SYSDATA:LOG/ directory, delete the following:

            VL_Config

4: If you manually entered either "VL_Creator_3.0" or "View_Log_3.0" into
   any of your Pfile directories, delete them from here also.

5: Don't worry about the "bbsmenu" file, because that will be dealt with
   later in the Installation instructions.

    That should take care of it for the previous version files. Now, refer
to the new VL_READ_ME! file for instructions on installing and using this
new version of View_Log_4.0...

===========================================================================
            THAT'S THE WHOLE BALL OF YARN FOR THIS FILE!
